{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01251",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 4.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.26,
      "end_seconds": 14.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.26,
      "end_seconds": 22.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "It's a dry tickly cough. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.06,
      "end_seconds": 27.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "So, can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.07,
      "end_seconds": 30.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "About... well, two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.0,
      "end_seconds": 39.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.17,
      "end_seconds": 52.84,
      "duration_seconds": 11.67,
      "text": "Actually, maybe a six out of ten on a bad day. Sips of water helps a bit. I'd say every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.57,
      "end_seconds": 55.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.89,
      "end_seconds": 67.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a little breathlessness as well. The little breathlessness? That's been for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.15,
      "end_seconds": 72.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "And what about heartburn, fever or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.69,
      "end_seconds": 78.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "No, no heartburn, fever or coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.1,
      "end_seconds": 82.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.76,
      "end_seconds": 85.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.57,
      "end_seconds": 92.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.32,
      "end_seconds": 96.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.5,
      "end_seconds": 118.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.09,
      "end_seconds": 125.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.16,
      "end_seconds": 146.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Right, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.39,
      "end_seconds": 150.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.23,
      "end_seconds": 167.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "So, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.0,
      "end_seconds": 171.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "It's cough syrup, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.1,
      "end_seconds": 191.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.55,
      "end_seconds": 193.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.81,
      "end_seconds": 197.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.6,
      "end_seconds": 205.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.74,
      "end_seconds": 212.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.87,
      "end_seconds": 228.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.57,
      "end_seconds": 251.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 17, BP is 112 over 77, temperature is 36.5 degrees, heart rate 86, oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.49,
      "end_seconds": 254.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.28,
      "end_seconds": 264.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.24,
      "end_seconds": 268.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.57,
      "end_seconds": 274.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.87,
      "end_seconds": 277.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.86,
      "end_seconds": 291.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and there is no wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.52,
      "end_seconds": 308.65,
      "duration_seconds": 13.13,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is a persistent dry cough without a clear cause so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.54,
      "end_seconds": 314.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.94,
      "end_seconds": 331.04,
      "duration_seconds": 15.1,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a persistent dry cough without a clear cause so far do well once it's treated properly. I think a breathing test makes sense here, for cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.94,
      "end_seconds": 334.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Right, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.86,
      "end_seconds": 339.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for chronic cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.47,
      "end_seconds": 342.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Right, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.45,
      "end_seconds": 364.22,
      "duration_seconds": 19.77,
      "text": "We will review your tablets and see whether the cough settles over a month. If you cough up blood or lose weight, that's the point to come in urgently. I'll want another look in six weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.09,
      "end_seconds": 368.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}